      "rationale": "The trajectory used `which exiftool exif identify` to check for multiple EXIF tools simultaneously. The command returned exit code 1 (because not all tools were found) but successfully showed `/usr/bin/exiftool` was available. The agent correctly proceeded with the available tool rather than treating the non-zero exit code as a failure. This pattern efficiently discovers available tools without multiple round-trips.",
