        "Parse the output for any successfully located tools (lines showing paths like /usr/bin/toolname)",
        "Don't treat non-zero exit codes as complete failure—which returns 1 if any tool is missing but still outputs paths for found tools",
        "Proceed with any available suitable tool rather than requiring all to be present"
      ],
